# Build Presets Architecture

## Complete System Flow

```mermaid
flowchart TB
    subgraph INPUT ["👤 User Input"]
        CMD["/ts-turbo my-app 'idea' --preset=X --build=Y"]
    end

    subgraph EXTRACTION ["🔍 Signal Extraction"]
        direction TB
        FA[Founder-Advisor]
        
        subgraph SIGNALS ["Extracted Signals"]
            direction LR
            ARCH_SIG["Architecture Signals<br/>• persistent_data<br/>• python_ml<br/>• realtime<br/>• multi_user"]
            BUILD_SIG["Build Signals<br/>• prototype/POC/quick<br/>• MVP/v1/tool<br/>• production/enterprise"]
        end
        
        FA --> ARCH_SIG
        FA --> BUILD_SIG
    end

    subgraph SELECTION ["⚙️ Selection Engine"]
        direction TB
        
        subgraph PROB1 ["Problem #1: Architecture Preset"]
            PRESET_CFG[("presets.yaml")]
            PRESET_SELECT{"KISS<br/>Selection"}
            PRESET_OUT["Selected Preset<br/>+ Stack<br/>+ Eligible Agents"]
        end
        
        subgraph PROB2 ["Problem #2: Build Preset"]
            BUILD_CFG[("builds.yaml")]
            BUILD_SELECT{"Mode-Based<br/>Selection"}
            BUILD_OUT["Selected Build<br/>+ Stage Modes<br/>+ Build Agents"]
        end
        
        PRESET_CFG --> PRESET_SELECT
        BUILD_CFG --> BUILD_SELECT
    end

    subgraph MERGE ["🔀 Agent Resolution"]
        INTERSECT["Final Agents =<br/>Build Agents ∩ Arch Agents"]
        AGENT_LIST["Active Agent List"]
    end

    subgraph EXECUTION ["🚀 Stage Execution"]
        direction TB
        
        subgraph S1 ["Stage 1: Architecture"]
            S1_MODE{"Mode?"}
            S1_COMP["Compressed<br/>FA only"]
            S1_FULL["Full<br/>FA + EA"]
        end
        
        subgraph S2 ["Stage 2: Product"]
            S2_MODE{"Mode?"}
            S2_SKIP["Skip"]
            S2_LEAN["Lean<br/>PL only"]
            S2_FULL["Full<br/>PL + PP + BA"]
        end
        
        subgraph S3 ["Stage 3: Development"]
            S3_MODE{"Mode?"}
            S3_MIN["Minimal<br/>Devs only"]
            S3_FULL["Full<br/>All Dev Agents"]
        end
        
        subgraph S4 ["Stage 4: Release"]
            S4_MODE{"Mode?"}
            S4_SKIP["Skip"]
            S4_LEAN["Lean<br/>TW only"]
            S4_FULL["Full<br/>TW + SE + RE + DO"]
        end
    end

    subgraph OUTPUT ["📦 Output"]
        PROJ["PROJECT.md<br/>+ Generated Code<br/>+ Artifacts"]
    end

    %% Flow connections
    CMD --> FA
    ARCH_SIG --> PRESET_SELECT
    BUILD_SIG --> BUILD_SELECT
    
    PRESET_SELECT --> PRESET_OUT
    BUILD_SELECT --> BUILD_OUT
    
    PRESET_OUT --> INTERSECT
    BUILD_OUT --> INTERSECT
    INTERSECT --> AGENT_LIST
    
    AGENT_LIST --> S1_MODE
    
    S1_MODE -->|compressed| S1_COMP
    S1_MODE -->|full| S1_FULL
    S1_COMP --> S2_MODE
    S1_FULL --> S2_MODE
    
    S2_MODE -->|skip| S2_SKIP
    S2_MODE -->|lean| S2_LEAN
    S2_MODE -->|full| S2_FULL
    S2_SKIP --> S3_MODE
    S2_LEAN --> S3_MODE
    S2_FULL --> S3_MODE
    
    S3_MODE -->|minimal| S3_MIN
    S3_MODE -->|full| S3_FULL
    S3_MIN --> S4_MODE
    S3_FULL --> S4_MODE
    
    S4_MODE -->|skip| S4_SKIP
    S4_MODE -->|lean| S4_LEAN
    S4_MODE -->|full| S4_FULL
    
    S4_SKIP --> PROJ
    S4_LEAN --> PROJ
    S4_FULL --> PROJ

    %% Styling
    classDef input fill:#e1f5fe,stroke:#01579b
    classDef extraction fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#e65100
    classDef selection fill:#f3e5f5,stroke:#7b1fa2
    classDef merge fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32
    classDef execution fill:#fce4ec,stroke:#c2185b
    classDef output fill:#e0f2f1,stroke:#00695c
    
    class CMD input
    class FA,ARCH_SIG,BUILD_SIG extraction
    class PRESET_CFG,BUILD_CFG,PRESET_SELECT,BUILD_SELECT,PRESET_OUT,BUILD_OUT selection
    class INTERSECT,AGENT_LIST merge
    class S1_MODE,S1_COMP,S1_FULL,S2_MODE,S2_SKIP,S2_LEAN,S2_FULL,S3_MODE,S3_MIN,S3_FULL,S4_MODE,S4_SKIP,S4_LEAN,S4_FULL execution
    class PROJ output
```

---

## Build Preset Decision Flow

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    START([Start]) --> CHECK_FLAG{"--build flag<br/>provided?"}
    
    CHECK_FLAG -->|Yes| USE_FLAG["Use explicit build"]
    CHECK_FLAG -->|No| CHECK_CONFIG{"Config lock<br/>in preferences.yaml?"}
    
    CHECK_CONFIG -->|Yes| USE_CONFIG["Use config build"]
    CHECK_CONFIG -->|No| CHECK_SIGNAL{"Signal keywords<br/>detected?"}
    
    CHECK_SIGNAL -->|Yes| MATCH_SIGNAL{"Which signal?"}
    CHECK_SIGNAL -->|No| USE_DEFAULT{"Execution mode?"}
    
    MATCH_SIGNAL -->|"prototype/POC/quick"| PROTO["prototype"]
    MATCH_SIGNAL -->|"MVP/tool/v1"| MVP["mvp"]
    MATCH_SIGNAL -->|"production/client"| PROD["production"]
    
    USE_DEFAULT -->|Turbo| MVP
    USE_DEFAULT -->|HITL| PROD
    
    USE_FLAG --> RESULT
    USE_CONFIG --> RESULT
    PROTO --> RESULT
    MVP --> RESULT
    PROD --> RESULT
    
    RESULT([Selected Build Preset])
    
    style PROTO fill:#c8e6c9,stroke:#2e7d32
    style MVP fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#f9a825
    style PROD fill:#ffcdd2,stroke:#c62828
```

---

## Stage Modes by Build Preset

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    subgraph PROTOTYPE ["🏃 prototype"]
        direction TB
        P1["Stage 1<br/>COMPRESSED"]
        P2["Stage 2<br/>SKIP"]
        P3["Stage 3<br/>MINIMAL"]
        P4["Stage 4<br/>SKIP"]
        P1 --> P2 --> P3 --> P4
    end
    
    subgraph MVP ["⚖️ mvp"]
        direction TB
        M1["Stage 1<br/>FULL"]
        M2["Stage 2<br/>LEAN"]
        M3["Stage 3<br/>FULL"]
        M4["Stage 4<br/>LEAN"]
        M1 --> M2 --> M3 --> M4
    end
    
    subgraph PRODUCTION ["🏭 production"]
        direction TB
        R1["Stage 1<br/>FULL"]
        R2["Stage 2<br/>FULL"]
        R3["Stage 3<br/>FULL"]
        R4["Stage 4<br/>FULL"]
        R1 --> R2 --> R3 --> R4
    end
    
    PROTOTYPE -.->|"more ceremony"| MVP -.->|"more ceremony"| PRODUCTION
    
    style P1 fill:#c8e6c9
    style P2 fill:#e0e0e0
    style P3 fill:#c8e6c9
    style P4 fill:#e0e0e0
    
    style M1 fill:#a5d6a7
    style M2 fill:#fff9c4
    style M3 fill:#a5d6a7
    style M4 fill:#fff9c4
    
    style R1 fill:#81c784
    style R2 fill:#81c784
    style R3 fill:#81c784
    style R4 fill:#81c784
```

