## Config File Relationships

```mermaid
flowchart TB
    subgraph CONFIG ["📁 .claude/config/"]
        PREFS["preferences.yaml<br/>─────────────<br/>• default_preset<br/>• default_build<br/>• auto_select"]
        PRESETS["presets.yaml<br/>─────────────<br/>• static<br/>• embedded<br/>• fullstack-js<br/>• baas<br/>• microservice<br/>• cli-*"]
        BUILDS["builds.yaml<br/>─────────────<br/>• prototype<br/>• mvp<br/>• production"]
    end
    
    subgraph AGENTS ["📁 .claude/agents/"]
        FA["founder-advisor.md<br/>+ compressed mode"]
        EA["enterprise-architect.md"]
        TW["technical-writer.md<br/>+ lite mode"]
        OTHER["... other agents<br/>+ skip check"]
    end
    
    subgraph COMMANDS ["📁 .claude/commands/"]
        TURBO["ts-turbo.md<br/>--preset, --build"]
        NEW["ts-new-project.md<br/>--preset, --build"]
    end
    
    subgraph PROJECT ["📁 .claude/pipeline/projects/"]
        TEMPLATE["TEMPLATE.md<br/>─────────────<br/>• Architecture section<br/>• Build section<br/>• Agent summary"]
        PROJ["[PROJECT].md"]
    end
    
    PREFS --> PRESETS
    PREFS --> BUILDS
    
    PRESETS --> FA
    BUILDS --> FA
    
    PRESETS --> EA
    BUILDS --> TW
    BUILDS --> OTHER
    
    TURBO --> PREFS
    NEW --> PREFS
    
    TEMPLATE --> PROJ
    FA --> PROJ
    EA --> PROJ
    TW --> PROJ
    OTHER --> PROJ
    
    style PREFS fill:#e3f2fd
    style PRESETS fill:#e8f5e9
    style BUILDS fill:#fff3e0
    style PROJ fill:#f3e5f5
```

