## Complete Selection Example

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant CMD as Command Parser
    participant FA as Founder-Advisor
    participant SEL as Selection Engine
    participant EA as Enterprise Architect
    participant DEV as Developers
    participant OUT as Output

    U->>CMD: /ts-turbo todo "quick prototype todo app"
    
    Note over CMD: Parse flags<br/>--build not set<br/>--preset not set
    
    CMD->>FA: Analyze idea + extract signals
    
    Note over FA: Arch signals:<br/>persistent_data=Yes<br/>multi_user=No
    Note over FA: Build signals:<br/>"quick prototype" detected
    
    FA->>SEL: Signals extracted
    
    Note over SEL: Architecture KISS:<br/>persistent + !multi_user<br/>→ embedded
    Note over SEL: Build match:<br/>"prototype" signal<br/>→ prototype
    
    SEL->>SEL: Intersect agents
    Note over SEL: embedded ∩ prototype<br/>= 3 agents
    
    SEL->>FA: Execute (compressed mode)
    FA->>DEV: Direct handoff (skip EA, Stage 2)
    
    Note over DEV: database-developer<br/>frontend-developer
    
    DEV->>OUT: Code generated
    
    Note over OUT: Stage 4 skipped<br/>README only
    
    OUT->>U: ✅ Done in ~3 min
```
